III RCT...\"), and the materials all being Phase II, the decision should be `external_research`. I will formulate `external_ask` to search for completed Phase III RCTs published after these 2024/2026 sources, or check clinical trial registries for recently closed Phase III trials.\n    *   I will also prepare `quantitative_comparisons` and `usable_content` based on the Phase II data provided, as they form the current evidence ceiling and context for the review.\n\n3.  **Extract Quantitative Comparisons:**\n    *   Need to follow format: `research_object`, `result_or_measure`, `setting_or_time`, `groups` (list of dicts with `group` and `value`).\n    *   From MITRIC (P0578):\n        *   Research object: Advanced solid cancers progressing on ICIs (melanoma, HNSCC, RCC, MSI-H pancreatic cancer)\n        *   Result/measure: Objective response rate (ORR)\n        *   Setting/time: Single-arm phase IIa basket trial (MITRIC), data cut-off Sept 2025\n        *   Groups: [{group: \"All enrolled patients (n=12)\", value: \"0%\"}]\n        *   Result/measure: Median progression-free survival (PFS)\n        *   Groups: [{group: \"All enrolled patients\", value: \"1.5 months\"}]\n        *   Result/measure: Median overall survival (OS)\n        *   Groups: [{group: \"All enrolled patients\", value: \"10.1 months\"}]\n    *   From FMT-LUMINate (P0583):\n        *   Research object: First-line advanced NSCLC or melanoma\n        *   Result/measure: Objective response rate (ORR)\n        *   Setting/time: Multicenter open-label phase 2 trial (FMT-LUMINate)\n        *   Groups: [{group: \"NSCLC cohort (anti-PD-1 monotherapy, n=20)\", value: \"80%\"}, {group: \"Melanoma cohort (anti-PD-1 + anti-CTLA-4, n=20)\", value: \"75%\"}]\n    *   From FMT-LUMINate Abstract (P_7f83...):\n        *   Research object: Previously untreated advanced melanoma\n        *   Result/measure: Objective response rate (ORR)\n        *   Setting/time: Phase II trial (FMT-LUMINate, NCT04951583)\n        *  